# OpenWrt 25.x (this ImmortalWrt tree)

## Package manager

25.x uses **`apk`** (`.apk`). Do not use `opkg` / `.ipk` in docs, QA, or image scripts. `make world` writes an **apk** index.

## Kernel

OpenWrt **25.x** default is Linux **6.12**. This CM5 fork keeps rockchip on **6.18**:

```makefile
# target/linux/rockchip/Makefile
KERNEL_PATCHVER:=6.18
```

Patches: `target/linux/rockchip/patches-6.18/`. Do **not** retarget rockchip to 6.12. Skill **`rockchip-kernel-dts`**.

## Apps / RPC

LuCI backends in the sibling **openwrt-packages** feed are **ucode** (`/usr/share/rpcd/ucode/`, `rpcd-mod-ucode`), not shell/Lua `/usr/libexec/rpcd/`. Skill **`openwrt-25x`** in that repo.
